@startuml NGINX HTTP Request Processing

' 使用皮肤
skinparam {
  DefaultFontName "Arial"
  BackgroundColor white
  ArrowColor black
  BorderColor black
}

' 定义状态
state "客户端连接" as ClientConnection
state "接受连接" as AcceptConnection
state "读取请求" as ReadRequest
state "处理请求头" as ProcessHeaders
state "内容处理阶段" as ContentPhase {
  state "查找位置" as FindLocation
  state "访问控制" as AccessControl
  state "处理请求" as ProcessRequest
  state "内容生成" as GenerateContent
}
state "过滤响应" as FilterResponse {
  state "头部过滤器" as HeaderFilter
  state "内容过滤器" as ContentFilter
}
state "发送响应" as SendResponse
state "关闭连接" as CloseConnection

' 定义流程
[*] --> ClientConnection
ClientConnection --> AcceptConnection
AcceptConnection --> ReadRequest
ReadRequest --> ProcessHeaders
ProcessHeaders --> FindLocation
FindLocation --> AccessControl
AccessControl --> ProcessRequest
ProcessRequest --> GenerateContent
GenerateContent --> HeaderFilter
HeaderFilter --> ContentFilter
ContentFilter --> SendResponse
SendResponse --> CloseConnection : 如果不是长连接
SendResponse --> ReadRequest : 如果是长连接
CloseConnection --> [*]

' 添加注释
note right of AcceptConnection
  由事件模块处理
  (epoll/kqueue/select等)
end note

note right of ProcessHeaders
  解析HTTP请求头
  确定虚拟主机
end note

note right of FindLocation
  根据URI匹配location
  确定处理方式
end note

note right of ProcessRequest
  可能是：
  - 静态文件
  - FastCGI/uWSGI
  - 代理请求
  - 其他处理器
end note

note right of FilterResponse
  响应经过多个过滤器：
  - 头部过滤器
  - gzip压缩
  - 字符集转换
  - 其他过滤器
end note

@enduml
